<!-- Describe in detail what your merge request does and why. -->

Marked as draft until https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/40976 is addressed since we need those changes for a conformant tessellation. After that, we can drop that commit from this MR and proceed with the merge.

Implements tessellation the same way HK does. Geometry and transform feedback have been left out for 2 reasons: not a priority at the moment, and I had so much fun implementing and debugging issues that I want to leave some of that fun for later :)
